; Classify the time spent in the current room (room_time high byte, 256-frame units) for the enemy logic.
; Output: below $19: C = 0, V = 0. $19-$1F (6400 frames): C = 1, V = 0. $20 or more (8192 frames): C = 1,
; V = 1, A = $FF. The spawn timers and the enemy AI use C and V to shorten their delays.
get_room_time_level
